Package: hypoforgeR
Title: Experimental Feature Hypotheses, Calendar and Media Transformations
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("HypoForge", "Contributors", email = "hypoforge-maintainers@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Native R implementation of exploratory feature generation, transformation,
    numerical safety screening, redundancy filtering, calendar hypotheses,
    media response transformations and rolling-origin ridge model tournaments.
    Model-selection results are exploratory and require an untouched final test.
